# The Orb of Orahil: Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (4965, 4967, 4968, 4969)
# from your trainer to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet, and Fragments of the Orb
# of Orahil (1799). Menara's two acolytes then each offer one path, and the
# game lets you take only one (Shard of a Felhound 4962 and Shard of an
# Infernal 4963 exclude each other): the next guide is your choice of path,
# and both end with an off-hand orb or a staff.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0 and
# Questie-Forever) for the givers and the chain; Wowhead's Classic quest pages
# (wowhead.com/classic/quest=1799 and =4962, =4963) for taking the acolyte's
# path before the Infernal Orb; Wowhead Forever's Warlock class page
# (data/local/quest-audit/wowhead-class-quests.json): unchanged in Forever.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, so nothing here has been checked in game.

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 35 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 35
  accept 4968                         -- Demisette Cloyce

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 35 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 35
  accept 4965                         -- Briarthorn

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 35 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 35
  accept 4967                         -- Zevrost

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 35 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar.
  level 35
  accept 4969                         -- Kaal Soulreaper

step Menara Voidrender
  zone The Barrens
  tip Menara Voidrender and her two acolytes stand in the tower on the hill above Ratchet, beside Strahad Farsan. Next, choose one acolyte's path: the next guide is that choice.
  turnin 4968 only Human              -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4965 only Gnome              -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4967 only Orc,Troll          -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4969 only Undead             -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 1799
